/*
  RecentActivityFeed.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 shared surface · 0100 · RecentActivityFeed (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. The action labels + the empty-state copy
  mirror the web source (components/data-display/RecentActivityFeed.tsx + lib/activityIcons.ts)
  one-for-one — every `t(key, fallback)` the web feed resolves — plus the native P4 leaf chrome
  (relative time / loading / error / freshness) so the Swift sources hold no English literals. The
  relative-time entries lift the web `formatRelative` hardcoded phrases into the catalog, preserving the
  copy verbatim (the `{{count}}` token is interpolated by the surface). These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a per-surface table
  ("RecentActivityFeed") so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without editing the shared
  catalog.
*/

